# Cost-Optimized Model Routing Strategy for Beacon API
**Author:** Juno Cross  
**Department:** Research  
**Project:** Beacon API  
**Produced:** D16 01:15  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Analysis and configuration deliverable for Project Beacon API evaluating model routing costs, leveraging baseline financial targets from Company Document to implement a tiered fallback strategy that minimizes token expenditures.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "routing_policy": {
    "name": "Beacon_API_Tiered_Cost_Optimizer",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "cost_reduction_target": "35% monthly token cost reduction",
    "baseline_reference": "Company Document (Business Document)",
    "reference_notes": "Utilized Company Document to extract SLA thresholds and allocated per-request cost caps across SaaS Platform endpoints.",
    "rules": [
      {
        "tier": "Tier_1_Low_Complexity",
        "description": "Basic classifications, intent detection, and short queries",
        "cost_ceiling_per_1k_tokens": 0.00015,
        "primary_model": "gemini-1.5-flash-8b",
        "fallback_model": "gemini-1.5-flash",
        "routing_condition": "prompt_tokens < 300 && task_type in ['classification', 'routing', 'entity_extraction']"
      },
      {
        "tier": "Tier_2_Medium_Complexity",
        "description": "Standard agentic interactions and summarize SaaS Face-to-Face logs",
        "cost_ceiling_per_1k_tokens": 0.0010,
        "primary_model": "gemini-1.5-flash",
        "fallback_model": "gemini-1.5-pro",
        "routing_condition": "task_type in ['summarization', 'chat_f2f_service'] && prompt_tokens < 2000"
      },
      {
        "tier": "Tier_3_High_Complexity",
        "description": "Deep analysis, heavy reasoning, or code generation",
        "cost_ceiling_per_1k_tokens": 0.0050,
        "primary_model": "gemini-1.5-pro",
        "fallback_model": null,
        "routing_condition": "task_type in ['deep_think', 'complex_audit'] || prompt_tokens >= 2000"
      }
    ],
    "telemetry_and_auditing": {
      "enforce_hard_limit": true,
      "cost_tracking_metric": "token_spend_per_route",
      "review_cadence": "weekly"
    }
  }
}
```